OL,3,GNEWSATeams bid to reach Rome in old
OL,4,AFiats for charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeams are driving from the UK to Rome
OL,7,Fin Fiat 500s bought for under #500 to
OL,8,Fraise money for charity and awareness
OL,9,Fof men's health.
OL,11,FStuart Bailey, from Rusper in West
OL,12,FSussex, organised the Mo Bros Race to
OL,13,FRome involving eight cars, all over 15
OL,14,Fyears old.
OL,16,FThe challenge supports the Movember
OL,17,Fcharity, which campaigns for and funds
OL,18,Fprogrammes on health issues including
OL,19,Fmental health, prostate cancer and
OL,20,Ftesticular cancer.
